+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Landscape report
+
+Creates or refreshes a landscape report that aggregates the repository analyses found under an analysis root:
+> java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
+
+`analyzeLandscape` is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands. It takes the same options as `updateLandscape`, which is kept as an alias for existing scripts:
+> java -jar sokrates.jar updateLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
+
+Both create `<folder>/_sokrates_landscape/config.json` and the landscape report (`index.html`) next to it. Use `-help` for the options, e.g. `java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -help`.
\ No newline at end of file
